The '''Ring of Arc''' is an artifact containing the [[Legendary Titan]] of Fate, [[Arc]]. Anyone in contact with the ring suffers from intense visions related to that person's fears. The ring was responsible for [[Joan of Arc|Joan of Arc]]'s spiritual powers.

